{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、今日は結構ゆったりしていたので\n部屋の整理整頓をしました！\n中学生活が終わりというのもきっかけに\n思い切ってダンシャリました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1589422/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっきりした〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1589422/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タンスの奥に白いハイソックスが大量に\nもう要らないのに...(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく時間がかかったけど・・・\n昔もらったおばあちゃんからのお小遣いも発見！ラッキー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1589422/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日３/２９は深川まいまいの誕生日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1589422/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとーっヾ(´・∀・)ノ << Happy Birthday♪\nまいまいのマイペースな性格に癒されてます。\nいつも優しくしてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1589422/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n明日は東京個別握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1589422/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと直接お話できるの楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1589422/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時期、暑いのか？寒いのか？\n私服どんなのにしようか迷うっ\nさっきまで一生懸命選んでました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1589422/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは\n明日いらっしゃる方\nシーユートゥマロッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いらっしゃれない方\nハヴァナイスウィークエンッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の写メは、ななみんと♪\nよく話したり一緒にふざけたりするんだけど、ほんとにおもしろいっ(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1589422/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}